stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: Server records unique result
    Pending --> Received: Authorized recipient fetches item
    Received --> AppliedDurably: Apply effect and record durable handled identity
    Received --> Received: Retry fetch / no second application
    AppliedDurably --> AckPending: Submit acknowledgement
    AckPending --> AckPending: Network failure / retry acknowledgement only
    AckPending --> Acknowledged: Server accepts acknowledgement
    AppliedDurably --> AppliedDurably: Duplicate delivery / use handled identity
    Acknowledged --> Acknowledged: Repeated acknowledgement / no new effect
